Comment: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:05.98,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,呃…
Comment: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:08.49,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,总感觉身体很沉…
Comment: 0,0:00:08.49,0:00:11.24,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,篠崎先生 你是苦夏了吗？
Comment: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:12.62,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,感觉体力还得恢复
Comment: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:13.24,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,但晚饭
Comment: 0,0:00:13.24,0:00:14.91,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,我明明吃了能量定食啊…
Comment: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:16.37,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,这种时候
Comment: 0,0:00:16.37,0:00:18.33,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,应该避免油腻的食物
Comment: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:20.33,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,吃对有助于消化的温热食物
Comment: 0,0:00:20.33,0:00:21.83,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,反而会更好哦！
Comment: 0,0:00:21.83,0:00:23.84,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,道理我懂 但难实现啊…
Comment: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:26.92,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,真拿你这个后辈没办法
Comment: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:27.67,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,那就
Comment: 0,0:00:27.67,0:00:29.72,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,在今天的提问环节结束后
Comment: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:31.93,Red,,0,0,0,karaoke,前辈我就来给你做吧！
Comment: 0,0:00:31.93,0:00:33.89,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,前辈…亲自下厨？！
Comment: 0,0:00:33.89,0:00:35.51,Blue,,0,0,0,karaoke,那么 赶紧提出问题吧！
